      "writtenOn": "2024-01-16T22:46:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "shareIn converts the cold flow to a hot flow: https://kotlinlang.org/api/kotlinx.coroutines/kotlinx-coroutines-core/kotlinx.coroutines.flow/share-in.html\n\nAlso, this allows the user to have more control on when the action is cancelled as opposed to ending as soon as the collection ends (which is not what we want in most cases).",
      "parentUuid": "fa867e9b_4b15d3fe",
      "revId": "800fca855b5601bbc7ea7df89096a127db720242",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
